{"channelId":"UCq62REpc0T9mNFTe9VRRhkQ","row":["SCOTTeVEST",7150,"When you want to revolutionize the clothing industry, you can’t just slap some extra fabric on a vest and call it a day. You may think, “It’s just pockets, it’s not like it’s rocket science.” But you would be wrong! When you’re adding as many as 42 pockets onto a piece of clothing, each with its own engineered purpose, there is a laundry list of considerations and challenges. What will be going in these pockets? How heavy will it be? Should the pockets be hidden? Should we add a zipper? Velcro? Magnets! So yeah… not rocket science, but definitely Pocket Science! And while they’re not sending monkeys into space, we think our Scientists are pretty darn special.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq62REpc0T9mNFTe9VRRhkQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq62REpc0T9mNFTe9VRRhkQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:33.256Z","channelId":"UCq62REpc0T9mNFTe9VRRhkQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"22092bb99b61b2108b8efd66bb83b2a5fec0be3ebfae44a51d0b4a7034b0ee68","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ef06cd2146d2845fd1e4a831f3780c93eea70dd912884bdd1b49a91261938f2a"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq62REpc0T9mNFTe9VRRhkQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:33.256Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq62REpc0T9mNFTe9VRRhkQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":7150,"raw":"7.15K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq62REpc0T9mNFTe9VRRhkQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:33.256Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uy1CJf9Efpg"]}],"cleanup":{"status":